"title\":\"Indagine: pochi utenti smartphone puntano su foldable o AI\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un sondaggio CNET/YouGov, solo il 13% valuterebbe un upgrade per telefoni pieghevoli e il 12% per integrazioni AI.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14798,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T16:00:44+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-12T07:59:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"11-motivi-per-aspettare-iphone-18-pro\",\"title\":\"11 motivi per aspettare iPhone 18 Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo i rumor, iPhone 18 Pro potrebbe arrivare con cambiamenti su design, batteria, Dynamic Island, display, chip e modem, oltre a novità camera e connettività satellitare 5G.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14730,\"date\":\"2026-05-09T09:51:58+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-09T07:51:58+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-watch-series-12-watchos-27-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Series 12 e watchOS 27: cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su Touch ID, nuovi chip, nuove watch face e funzioni Apple Intelligence e satellite in watchOS 27, con lancio atteso a settembre.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-Touch-ID-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-Touch-ID\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14711,\"date\":\"2026-05-08T10:30:10+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-08T06:36:54+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-spatial-iphone-rumor-display-olografico-samsung\",\"title\":\"Apple “Spatial iPhone” in arrivo? Rumor su display olografico Samsung\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker, Samsung starebbe sviluppando un display olografico per un presunto “Spatial iPhone”. Nessun dettaglio verificato, ma emergono codename e tecnologie chiave.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Could-Be-Working-on-Spatial-iPhone-With-Holographic-Display-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Could-Be-Working-on-Spatial-iPhone-With-Holographic-Display-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14671,\"date\":\"2026-05-07T15:36:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-07T13:36:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-piu-riparabile-foldable\",\"title\":\"“iPhone Ultra” potrebbe essere il pieghevole più riparabile\",\"excerpt\":\"Il leaker Instant Digital sostiene che il design interno dell’iPhone Ultra renderebbe lo smontaggio e la riparazione più semplici rispetto ad altri pieghevoli.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-Iridescent-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-Iridescent-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":6,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14667,\"date\":\"2026-05-07T15:36:01+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-07T13:36:01+00:00\",\"slug\":\"leaker-apple-ritarda-iphone-18-strategia-di-mercato\",\"title\":\"Leaker: Apple ritarda iPhone 18 per strategia di mercato\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo il leaker “Fixed Focus Digital”, Apple avrebbe scelto di ritardare l’iPhone 18 standard per estendere le vendite di iPhone 17, ridurre i costi e rafforzarsi contro i rivali Android.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-17-models-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-models\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14643,\"date\":\"2026-05-06T15:00:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-06T07:08:45+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-potrebbe-avvicinarsi-a-iphone-18e-componenti-condivisi\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 potrebbe avvicinarsi molto a iPhone 18e: indiscrezioni su componenti condivisi\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo il leaker “Fixed Focus Digital”, iPhone 18 e iPhone 18e condividerebbero alcuni componenti, suggerendo un restringimento del divario tra i due modelli.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-17e-notch-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17e-notch\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14545,\"date\":\"2026-05-03T20:51:42+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-03T18:51:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-air-2-unico-top-ultra-sottile\",\"title\":\"iPhone Air 2 potrebbe restare l’unico top ultra-sottile\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker su Weibo, le vendite deboli di iPhone Air avrebbero spinto rivali e produttori a rinunciare a piani per telefoni ultra-sottili. iPhone Air 2 sarebbe quindi in pole come unica proposta di fascia alta.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-17-air-768x431.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-air\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14531,\"date\":\"2026-05-03T20:51:23+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-03T18:51:23+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-nuove-funzioni-siri-interfaccia-touch-stabilita\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: nuove funzioni Siri, interfaccia touch e più stabilità\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo le indiscrezioni, macOS 27 arriverà a settembre dopo beta a giugno e luglio: app Siri dedicata, funzioni Apple Intelligence, ottimizzazioni touch e stop al supporto AFP.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/macOS-27-on-MacBook-Pro-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-on-MacBook-Pro\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14527,\"date\":\"2026-05-03T20:49:26+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-03T18:49:26+00:00\",\"slug\":\"perche-potresti-aspettare-prima-di-comprare-un-macbook-pro\",\"title\":\"Perché potresti aspettare prima di comprare un MacBook Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha aggiornato il MacBook Pro 14” e 16” con M5 Pro e M5 Max, ma i rumor indicano un salto di generazione con display OLED touch, nuovo design e chip a processo 2nm nel 2026-2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-MacBook-Pro-M4-hero-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-MacBook-Pro-M4-hero\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14471,\"date\":\"2026-04-28T00:37:42+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-27T22:37:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-due-nuovi-prodotti-ultra\",\"title\":\"Apple: in arrivo due nuovi prodotti “Ultra”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Macworld, Apple pianifica di lanciare un “iPhone Ultra” pieghevole e un “MacBook Ultra” con display OLED e touchscreen nel prossimo anno.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Apple-Logo-Black-768x429.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14443,\"date\":\"2026-04-25T12:32:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-25T10:32:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-macbook-ultra-fino-a-sei-nuove-funzioni\",\"title\":\"Apple “MacBook Ultra”: fino a sei nuove funzioni in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, Apple starebbe preparando un grande redesign per i MacBook Pro di fascia alta, con possibile branding “MacBook Ultra” e fino a sei nuove funzioni: OLED, touch, Dynamic Island, chip M6 Pro/M6 Max, design più sottile e connettività cellulare.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14441,\"date\":\"2026-04-25T12:32:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-25T10:32:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-pieghevole-possibili-5-funzioni-mancanti-2000-dollari\",\"title\":\"iPhone Ultra pieghevole: possibili 5 funzioni mancanti a 2.000 dollari\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo immagini di dummy, l’iPhone Ultra pieghevole potrebbe mancare MagSafe e Action Button, oltre ad altre funzioni presenti su iPhone 18 Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-Iridescent-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-Iridescent-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14417,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:12:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07:12:34+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-piano-upgrade-camera-quattro-fasi\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: Apple valuta un piano di upgrade camera in quattro fasi\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker cinese, Apple starebbe pianificando quattro aggiornamenti per le fotocamere dei futuri iPhone: il primo riguarderebbe l’iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iphone-17-cameras-zoom-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-cameras-zoom\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14378,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:10:53+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07:10:53+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-airpods-pro-videocamere-ir-2026\",\"title\":\"Nuovi AirPods Pro con videocamere IR: cosa aspettarsi nel 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo indiscrezioni, Apple starebbe lavorando a una nuova variante degli AirPods Pro con piccole videocamere a infrarossi. Possibili novità su gesti, audio spaziale con Vision Pro, chip H3 e prezzi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/airpods-pro-3-glitter-blue-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-glitter-blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14353,\"date\":\"2026-04-19T16:03:09+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-19T14:03:09+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-carplay-ultra-arrivo-nuovi-marchi-auto\",\"title\":\"Apple: CarPlay Ultra in arrivo su nuovi marchi di auto\",\"excerpt\":\"Dopo il lancio di CarPlay Ultra, Apple indica un’espansione verso altri brand: tra questi Hyundai, Kia e Genesis, con possibili novità nella seconda metà dell’anno.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Aston-Martin-CarPlay-Ultra-Screen-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Aston-Martin-CarPlay-Ultra-Screen\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14330,\"date\":\"2026-04-18T13:32:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-18T11:32:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-quattro-colori-dark-cherry\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: quattro colori in arrivo, incluso “Dark Cherry”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Macworld, iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max potrebbero arrivare con quattro colorazioni, tra cui “Dark Cherry” (rosso vino).\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/macworld-iphone-18-pro-colors-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macworld-iphone-18-pro-colors\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14314,\"date\":\"2026-04-18T12:54:09+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-18T10:54:09+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-apple-watch-nuove-funzioni-satellitari-amazon\",\"title\":\"iPhone e Apple Watch: nuove funzioni satellitari con Amazon\",\"excerpt\":\"Amazon ha annunciato un accordo con Apple per fornire connettività satellitare alle funzioni attuali e future di iPhone e Apple Watch. Il passaggio a satelliti Amazon Leo è previsto nel 2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Emergency-SOS-via-Satellite-iPhone-YT-768x430.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Emergency-SOS-via-Satellite-iPhone-YT\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14176,\"date\":\"2026-04-11T14:58:46+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-11T12:58:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"rumor-iphone-pieghevole-cosa-e-cambiato-e-cosa-sappiamo-ora\",\"title\":\"Rumor iPhone pieghevole: cosa è cambiato e cosa sappiamo ora\",\"excerpt\":\"Le indiscrezioni sull’iPhone pieghevole di Apple aumentano: il dispositivo è entrato in una nuova fase di test prima della produzione di massa. Ecco i punti principali su nome, design, tempistiche e prezzo.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Apple-Foldable-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Foldable-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14150,\"date\":\"2026-04-07T22:08:17+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-07T20:08:17+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-pieghevole-design-svelato-immagini-modelli-dummy\",\"title\":\"iPhone pieghevole: design svelato in immagini di modelli dummy\",\"excerpt\":\"Sonny Dickson ha condiviso immagini dei primi dummy di iPhone 18 Pro, iPhone 18 Pro Max e del primo iPhone pieghevole, con un design “passport-style”.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPad\",\"categorySlug\":\"ipad\",\"categoryId\":10,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/sonny-dickson-iphone-18-fold-dummy-models-768x417.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"sonny-dickson-iphone-18-fold-dummy-models\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14116,\"date\":\"2026-04-02T13:27:10+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-02T11:27:10+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-17e-vs-iphone-17-guida-acquisto-differenze\",\"title\":\"iPhone 17e vs iPhone 17: guida all’acquisto con 35+ differenze\",\"excerpt\":\"A parità di chip A19 e funzioni come Face ID e Apple Intelligence, iPhone 17e e iPhone 17 cambiano soprattutto su display, fotocamere, connettività e autonomia. Ecco le principali differenze.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iPhone-17-v-17e-Buyers-Guide-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-17-v-17e-Buyers-Guide-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14059,\"date\":\"2026-03-26T21:33:17+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-26T20:33:17+00:00\",\"slug\":\"niente-grandi-cambiamenti-design-apple-watch-2026\",\"title\":\"Niente grandi cambiamenti di design per Apple Watch nel 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman di Bloomberg, non sono attesi cambiamenti di design importanti per i prossimi modelli di Apple Watch in arrivo più tardi nel 2026.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-768x431.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"revi